@startuml
title US010 - To register a new publication in MiteLovers to add to library

hide circle

class UI010 {
}

class RegisterNewPublicationCtrl {
+createAndAddPublication(pub1)
}

class PublicationRepository{

-validate (pub1)
+createAndAddPublicationToSystem(pub1)
}

class Publication {
+createAndAddPublication(pub1)
}

' interactions
UI010 "1" ..> "1" RegisterNewPublicationCtrl : contacts
RegisterNewPublicationCtrl "1" ..> "1" PublicationRepository : uses
PublicationRepository "1" -> "*" Publication : owns

'missing cardinalities

@enduml